        "body": "## CDK Kotlin 0.17.0-rc.0\n\nKotlin/Android bindings for the Cashu Development Kit.\n\n### Installation\n\nAdd to your `build.gradle.kts`:\n\n```kotlin\ndependencies {\n    implementation(\"org.cashudevkit:cdk-kotlin:0.17.0-rc.0\")\n}\n```\n\n### Changes\n\nBuilt from CDK repository: cashubtc/cdk@v0.17.0-rc.0",
